---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import CtaButton from "../components/CtaButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home"
  description="Serpico AI — AI consulting, process optimization, product development, marketing, and systems integration, backed by hands-on 1:1 training."
>
  <Hero
    heading="Turn AI Strategy Into Tools That Run Your Business"
    subheading="Expert-led AI consulting. Hands-on workshops. Custom corporate engagements. Practical AI systems that ship."
  >
    <CtaButton href="/services" variant="primary">Explore Consulting Services</CtaButton>
    <CtaButton href="/training" variant="secondary">Get 1:1 Training</CtaButton>
  </Hero>

  <Section title="Who We Serve">
    <p><strong>Individual Learners</strong> — Professionals mastering AI skills through workshops or private 1:1 development sessions.</p>
    <p><strong>Entrepreneurs &amp; Business Leaders</strong> — From AI discovery sessions to hands-on 1:1 coaching, understand AI strategy without becoming a full-time technologist.</p>
    <p><strong>Teams &amp; Organizations</strong> — Companies ready to upskill their workforce with practical AI training that drives real business results.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What You'll Gain">
    <p>A real-time approach that updates as fast as AI evolves — not a static program that goes stale.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Intro to AI</strong> — Demystify AI, understand what's real vs. hype, and learn exactly how to start using AI in your daily work.</li>
      <li><strong>Prompt Engineering Fundamentals</strong> — Master the art of communicating with AI to get consistent, high-quality results every time.</li>
      <li><strong>Industry Expert Use Cases</strong> — Learn from practitioners actively deploying AI across businesses, marketing, operations, and decision-making.</li>
      <li><strong>Image &amp; Video Generation</strong> — Transform into a one-person creative studio. Generate professional visuals in minutes, not days.</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing and Sales Applications</strong> — Automate outreach, generate content, and scale personalization without scaling headcount.</li>
      <li><strong>Cutting Edge Insights</strong> — Stay ahead with sessions that update within days of major AI releases.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="1:1 Training, One Way We Work With You">
    <p>Our consulting practice includes hands-on 1:1 sessions — one engagement format among several, alongside corporate advisory and workshops.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Expert-Led Instruction</strong> — Every session is taught by someone actively deploying AI, not reading from outdated slides.</li>
      <li><strong>Book a Session</strong> — Pick a time. $175/hour, paid before we start.</li>
      <li><strong>Bring Your Idea</strong> — An app, a workflow, a product, whatever you want to build. And your laptop.</li>
      <li><strong>You Build, We Teach</strong> — Your instructor guides you through architecture, prompting, debugging, and deployment. You write every prompt and make every decision.</li>
      <li><strong>Walk Away With Skills &amp; a Tool to Meet Your Need</strong> — You leave with a working application and the ability to build the next one without help.</li>
    </ol>
    <CtaButton href="/training" variant="primary">Get 1:1 Training</CtaButton>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What People Are Saying">
    <blockquote>
      <p>&quot;Right now, the infrastructure innovators need includes AI education that keeps pace with change. Serpico AI Learning Center delivers exactly that.&rdquo;</p>
      <p>— Jeff Saville, Executive Director, Center for Entrepreneurial Innovation (CEI)</p>
    </blockquote>
    <!--
      This testimonial is a direct, attributed quote and is kept verbatim,
      including its reference to the prior "Serpico AI Learning Center" name
      — per this plan's Constraints, rewording someone's actual quoted words
      would be fabrication, which is a harder rule than the "no Learning
      Center mentions" stylistic goal. This is the deliberate historical-quote
      exception Step 1's own verify-by anticipates.
    -->
    <blockquote>
      <p>&quot;AI is evolving faster than any technology shift we've seen before. Traditional training models can't keep up.&quot;</p>
      <p>— Vincent Serpico, Founder</p>
    </blockquote>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <p>Proud partner of the Center for Entrepreneurial Innovation (CEI) — Arizona's leading nonprofit business incubator.</p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
